#* {{quote-book|en|year=c. 1621|author=[[w:John Fletcher (playwright)|John Fletcher]]|title=The Pilgrim|section=act I, scene ii|passage=He turns from us; / Alas, he weeps too! Something '''presses''' him / He would reveal, but dare not. Sir, be comforted.}}
